id: 12F-017
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: No graceful shutdown handler — Go (12-Factor IX: Disposability)
category: quality
severity: info
engine: absence
target:
  extensions: .go
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ _test.go
  content_contains: ListenAndServe
patterns:
  - regex: signal\.Notify\(
    message: Go server without signal.Notify — may lose in-flight requests on shutdown
fix: Use signal.NotifyContext or signal.Notify(ch, syscall.SIGTERM) for graceful shutdown (12-Factor IX)
